BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 703 Td (When isolated buyers optimize their decisions, they do so strictly within the) Tj ET
50 690 Td (payoff matrix defined by suppliers. If every individual chooses the least) Tj ET
50 677 Td (unfavorable option among poor terms, the aggregate telemetry received by the) Tj ET
50 664 Td (market signals that the terms are acceptable and clearing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 645 Td (This produces a structural asymmetry:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
