50 581 Td (2. **Buyer Atomization:** Buyers, operating in isolation, cannot pool bargaining) Tj ET
50 568 Td (commitments, credibly signal collective reservation prices, or execute coordinated) Tj ET
50 555 Td (exit without formal coordination mechanisms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 536 Td (Consequently, as the variety of superficial choices expands, buyer fragmentation) Tj ET
50 523 Td (deepens, further contracting collective agency.) Tj ET
