50 396 Td (cancellation constraints.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 377 Td (  **Objection: Buyer heterogeneity makes coalition formation impossible.**) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
50 358 Td (*Analytical Clarification:* DC2SC does not require global consensus. It) Tj ET
50 345 Td (investigates bounded subsets of non-compensable constraint floors where overlap is) Tj ET
50 332 Td (voluntary and contestable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg
